I'm a software engineer interested in functional-relational programming,
systems programming, and mathematical solvers.

At [RelationalAI](https://relational.ai), I lead the integration of
[prescriptive reasoning](https://docs.relational.ai/build/reasoning/prescriptive) into our
product. This lets you solve decision problems over your declarative ontology
using open-source and commercial solvers.

You can reach me over on [GitHub](https://github.com/bachdavi),
[X](https://x.com/bachdavi), or [email me](mailto:david.bach@fastmail.com).
